When you load my app (https://asashinyapps.shinyapps.io/shootingshinyapp/) and go to the xGoals navbar item, and down to team, you see two datatable tables. Whenever I first load the app on shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io>, the first data table on that is forced to show 10 rows. It is not forced to show 10 rows on my local version, and if you click a few controls in the sidebar, the issue goes away.

In other words, this does not seem to be a silly coding issue. shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> for whatever reason initially displays an errant datatable, and then corrects it when controls are changed.

Any ideas on why this might be?

