There is a known issue with R 3.4.x and Java on shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> that requires either rolling back to R 3.3.x or to place options(java.parameters = "-Xss2048k") ahead anything that causes java to start.

It appears you might be using xlsx which is known to trigger this issue.

Hope that helps!

