I have been discussing the possibility of opening a shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> Professional plan with other developers at my research institute. At the current time, I am unsure how many other developers will be interested in having access to the account, but I was unable to find information on the shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> website regarding the number of Shiny developers that can share an organizational professional account. Are there any such limits?
Thanks,
Andrea

